   "id": "tx3401",
   "x": 420,
   "y": 430,
   "width": 870,
   "height": 52.5,
   "text": "The verdict is a continuous score (0.73), the probability mass across the ordered levels, and a\ncalibrated confidence (0.90). Because the confidence is calibrated, a fixed accept-threshold on the\nscore is meaningful (see calibration).",
